#: scenario8:scenario8_D79F677D_5E95_4455_BF87_F7E1F3AB05DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b2adda2dd67e2044344c9a0341713e7c580e7287787883893512f9a26644ad30
