msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D79F677D_5E95_4455_BF87_F7E1F3AB05DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫No, I made the right decision. Even if he doesn’t in this life... ⟪k:2⟫there’s enough "
"of a chance that he will in his next."
