#: scenario8:scenario8_89B80F4D_D25E_472B_A190_7D154859DC46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07e09fda198b2b58ec23699e82582300334034c698316aaa837f3e977891f2c1
